An alternative to the above Generator implementation is to provide an inverted exit condition. However, this pattern can be confusing for some and doesn't work as well in all scenarios (such as filling an Array).

```gdscript
func handle_packets():
  while true:
    var packet = get_packet()
    if packet == null: # <-- Inverted logic to exit early
      break
    handle_packet(packet)
```
